{"server":"cn","storyId":"act23side_level_act23side_01_beg","groupId":"act23side","stageId":"act23side_01","title":"塞上春来","storyCode":"WB-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"11714561a706e2e9c67ba74f2c42bef1c80271e9e32c27a89f876774aed581d1","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"天灾信使遇害引起了众人的警觉，太傅指出“巨兽信徒”可能在筹谋着对玉门不利的计划，就在众人商议对策之际，一场针对魏彦吾的刺杀发生了。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g9_yumensuburb"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军A","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"进了玉门城，应该已经安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要掉以轻心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先回军营，将数据送去钦天监，再向左将军汇报城外的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军A","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，我话音还没落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军A","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有埋伏！保护林特使往回撤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，我们已经被包围了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敢在玉门城内拦截官军，什么人？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"来历不明的凶徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林特使小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"来历不明的凶徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将沙石变成玻璃......很奇特的法术。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在城外就觉得蹊跷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的目标是天灾观测数据吧。你们截杀了信使队伍，但并没有找到数据，只能草草将现场布置成流寇洗劫......拙劣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"来历不明的凶徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先杀了那个女人，东西一定还在她身上，当心源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仗着人多？呵......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"重器破空而来，击飞林雨霞身前的凶徒，尾势未消，直至砸碎路面的石板。\n那是一柄普通的锤。锻铁碎石，不知道多少时日，粗糙的锤面变得光滑。\n来人捡起锤，挡在林雨霞身前。\n那是一位普通的刀匠。脸庞被炉火燎红，又被风沙犁出沟壑，像是一面废弃的军鼓，粗糙，但仍坚韧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放肆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"来历不明的凶徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孟叔，我去追！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遥夜，先赶紧看看那几位战士怎么样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贼人下手很歹毒，姑娘有没有事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们还伤不到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几个军士受了伤，但没有性命之忧，只是晕过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然敢在城里光明正大地找官军的麻烦，真不晓得这帮人是什么来历。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孟叔，你为什么不让我追出去抓一个回来审审？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不清楚敌人底细......遥夜，别总那么莽撞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看打扮，姑娘不是玉门人，又有玉门守军保护，想必不是普通人。不知道这伙贼人为了什么要找你的麻烦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"官家事，别多问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这个人......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是什么人？又为什么出现在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孟铁衣，在城南开了一家铸剑坊。这位是刚从尚蜀来的杜遥夜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉门第一家物流公司“行裕物流”的老板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们准备到城门口接人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从尚蜀带来的两个兄弟第一次走玉门的镖，还是护送天灾信使这样的大活儿，当然要迎接了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孟叔，算时间他们该回来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天灾信使......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，你们不用去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g7_zuosroom"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公莫非又看上我这军帐里的哪样兵器了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罢了，反正我是都用不着了，你要是喜欢，不如连我那军武库整个搬到龙门去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"平祟侯说笑了。这些兵器，即使左兄用不着，也是要留给玉门的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果记得没错，十年前魏公和我打赌，赚走了我刚寻来的一把名剑。五年前，魏公又趁酒后带走了天师府送我的一张弓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们今天喝酒对赌，你尽管赢，别再让着我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过是些玩笑话。这么多年，龙门持续为玉门供应物资，一次都没有耽误过。单冲这一点，我也该送魏公几件礼物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"分内的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可魏兄身为龙门总督，事务繁忙......今天还特意来到玉门巡视，总该不是分内的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"算是私事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门离了魏总督几天，还不至于起什么乱子，但魏彦吾能趁机看看老朋友，倒也不是一件坏事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"宗师离任的日子快到了，我正好送送他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗师的离任，可的确是件麻烦事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的那把剑，需要妥善处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，说来说去，这麻烦的话题还是回到了我头上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"宗师，令小姐，好久不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的确有些日子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今日这么多故人重逢，正当痛饮，不知道左将军提前备好了酒没有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凭令小姐在玉门的功劳，按道理是该陪你多喝几杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过今日，饮酒的事还得稍微等一等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说宗师心意已决，要将剑交给比武选出来的第一人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"武功只是第一道考验，值不值得将剑托付出去，我还有别的考量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为这件事，左将军早就是知道了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗师上次提起这件事的时候，局势也不同今日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可对我而言，这把剑总归是要托付给一个合适的人，而非合适的局势。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗师是觉得，这么久以来，军队上下，朝堂内外，身后眼前，竟无一个人合适了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好生热闹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有失远迎，太傅见谅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"多年未见，太傅的精神还是好得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诸位都是替大炎镇守边疆的有功之臣，风貌非常，现在齐聚一堂，也让我眼前一亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是今天有一些紧急事务，没有时间闲聊许久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人已到齐，左将军，让旁人退下吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来的路上，正好遇见从城外归来的巡防营斥候。听他说说情况吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两个时辰前，城头的守军看到了远处的求救信号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们赶到现场才发现......三日前玉门派出的天灾信使队伍，被截杀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g5_swordcastingworkshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遥夜，这不是你自己设计的镖旗吗，收起来做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是想打道回府？你是在后悔，不该让大小齐去跟这一趟镖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是后悔没有和他们一块去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也听刚刚那位女官差说了，十人的队伍无一生还，他们收到了求救讯息前去支援，还在回城时遭遇了截杀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对方可不是什么流寇。当时就算多你一个，又可以改变什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......孟叔，这样的事情，你是不是经历过很多次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行裕镖局十多年前曾来玉门走过几趟镖，我和你爹就是那时候认识的。这几年虽然往来不多，但交情不浅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹他也常提起孟叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半个月前，你跑到我这铸剑坊，说要成立自己的物流公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然只过了十几年，但如今什么事情都变了一变，年轻人想要自立门户，很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况你对行镖辨路、野外生存这些知识的了解一点也不比老江湖少，倒不愧是问霜客的女儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我因这才收留了你。虽然现代物流我不太懂，但在玉门待了这么多年，我多少能给你找些机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在看来，反而是我害了你的朋友......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把大小齐带到玉门的是我，让他们参与护送天灾信使的也是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"责任在我，我不会推脱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有这份觉悟，我就不担心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镖局也好，物流也好，万变不离其宗，赌上的是人命，为的也是人命。想要打出这行的招牌，就得知道肩上的分量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遥夜，无论你将来要不要走这条路，这一刻的心情，你要永远记着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，我当然会记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这次的凶手，我也绝对不会放过！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又忙了一天，快歇歇吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮你留了两道菜，已经叫后厨热过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这家客栈掌勺的手艺真不一般，我都想偷学两手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不饿......我吃不下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不靠谱的老爹得找，但饭也得吃。没有力气，到时候可怎么揍他呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（默默拿起筷子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天比武的时候不小心磕到了......一点小伤不要紧的！玉门的擂台从早设到晚，上来的高手可真不少，不过最后还是我赢了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难怪客栈常备着那么多伤药......你等着，我去拿点过来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"手伸出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也只有这种时候我才会想起来，你到底还是槐天裴的女儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和他才不一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个成年人，随随便便地撂挑子跑路，没担当。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我自己也可以生活得很好，但他离家出走的时候，我还没有成年，他已经违法了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说的没错。所以等我们找到他的时候，应该直接将他扭送近卫局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲤叔，你说他真的在这玉门城吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"传闻一年前有人在玉门见过他的踪迹，这是你梁叔给的消息。我也只有信他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他真的在玉门，应该已经在城门口的擂台榜上看见我的名字了。或者这么多年，哪怕路过龙门，也能来顺便看我一眼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他到底是不想找我，还是有意避着我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个父亲对孩子到底是怀着怎样的心思，我可真答不上来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但血浓于水，这点是无论如何不会改变的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直都相信，你们父女总会见面的。问题就在于，见了面后，你们能不能找到各自想要的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实......到现在我都不确定，自己到底有没有准备好见他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不如想想，假如现在走出去，和他在门口大街上撞个正着，你打算怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要狠狠地踹他下巴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g7_zuosroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情况如上所述，天灾数据已经送去钦天监观测台，也已根据测算结果给出了调整航道的新方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"受伤的军士均已送去医治。后续案情，林特使还在追查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我清楚了，你先下去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天灾将近，在关键时刻，玉门城中发生这样的事，是我失职。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"惭愧的话就免了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重要的是城中作乱奸徒的身份，平祟侯可有想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“山海众”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们本该在二十年前就被一网打尽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"千年前对巨兽的狩猎，结束了巨兽在大炎疆土上肆意横行的时代，但没能终结人们心中对那些庞然大物的信仰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"始终有人崇拜着巨兽强大的力量，将其奉若神明，并以巨兽信徒为名号，结朋营党，寻找巨兽的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台一直追踪着这支不法组织的动向，在那个罪人引起了那场动乱之后，这伙逆党似是受到了某种感召，行动又愈发频繁起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们以“山海众”自名。声称“山海八荒，尽归其主”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"口号荒唐，但的确吸引了不少信众。山海众成员构成复杂，更是借巨兽之名，行谋逆之事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些上千年的旧怨，竟然有人比我们还要放不下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十年过去了，这是他们第二次对玉门动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉门城本就是象征着大炎战胜巨兽的一座丰碑，这伙奸徒始终有理由对它不利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今玉门远行在即，山海众行动直指天灾情报，只怕他们已经得知了这次玉门的终点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"立即彻查此事。确保玉门平安，不容有失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十年前他们不曾得手，如今更无可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天召集大家，本来是为了共同商议如何处置宗师手中佩剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"经尚蜀一事，可以确信那罪人已在接触其他代理人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗师的剑，封印着岁兽本体十二分之一的意识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正因如此，剑的交付岂能儿戏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼下，其余一百八十枚黑子下落不明，他的下一步棋无人能料到会落在何处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将这纷纷世事比作棋路，也没有谁敢说能在算力上胜他一筹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台离那罪人距离过近，若由司岁台来保管，只怕会适得其反。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"面对这样一位对手，无理手反而有可能成为妙手。找寻一位恰当的局外人接手宗师佩剑，未尝不是一个办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这个弟弟，到底给大家添了不少麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......既然太傅和宗师都是这个意思，我姑且没有异议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅有何指教？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"协助平祟侯平定玉门城中的山海众，这是司岁台委托你做的最后一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到可以托付那把剑的人选后，朝廷许你在炎国疆土内自由行走，不会再加干涉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"纵使玉门百姓不知你身份名姓，哪怕百年后你我都已不在人世，司岁台藏书阁的卷宗，会牢牢记得你为大炎做的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大梦将醒，哪还会计较这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是不知该不该叹惋，终究还是不能陪这座城到最后一刻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"令小姐似乎还有想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们有没有闻到，一股花香......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎是，桃花？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桃花......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沙场肃杀之地，平祟侯的院落里，是没有种桃花的。\n这个时节的玉门，也不该有桃花开放。\n但在座每个人的确都闻到了，氤氲的香气如月光般穿过窗棂；也看到了，一片红似朱砂的花瓣飘到堂前，缓缓落下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这可当真是奇事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"仿佛凭空出现的一刀。\n刀尖离魏彦吾的喉咙不满一寸，寒意侵入肌肤，花香却沁人心脾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空手接得下我一刀，你可以骄傲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有这样的武功修为，为何要行偷袭暗杀这种卑劣之事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒想问，有那般强大的力量，为何要换这一副羸弱的身体？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我......?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅、左兄，诸位可都安好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这世上竟有人能躲过魏公和宗师联手一击，难以置信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢宗师出手相救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那样的本领，恐怕不只是拳脚上的功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗师，守军马上就到，捉拿刺客为先。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诸位当心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阁下倒是风雅，留下这一院落花便想洒然离开了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然有意叨扰筵席，那何不再多留片刻？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你拿什么留下我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g08_pavilion"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟然能认出这是梦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将自己一分为十二，还能保持这种能力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？你不仅知道我，还知道“他”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要见的是他......你不是他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自然是我，你又为什么要见他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便是在梦里，我也不愿意与你多浪费时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这黄粱一梦，也困不住我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_n"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来阁下的梦，也做了很长时间，呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然醒了，回到这纷扰尘世，就不免要真的刀兵相见了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"阁下有意要取我性命，不如就在这里把恩怨说清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想取你性命，又何必与你有恩怨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"没有恩怨，有手段也行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"阁下的本事，我再来领教过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还不够格。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女性向后退了一步。\n剑气如疾风掠草，但终究差了一寸。锋芒失其劲，而草不折。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"城头风大，小心沙子迷眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这帮人，亮相出手前一定要说上这么一句吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已无路可逃，束手就擒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人来得倒是多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_i02"},{"type":"narration","text":"女人缓缓抬起手中的长刀，刀光如月色。月亮本就是漆黑夜幕上的口子，春意尽数从这口子里泻出。\n三月里桃林正艳，行人失其踪，唯有花香渐浓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我想走，谁能将我留下？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彦吾"]}]}
